    "body": "> a BFCached page should be evicted only on locking contention with a fully active page\r\n\r\nA BFCached page may be evicted for any number of reasons unrelated to this API. Rather than say that a page will _only_ be evicted due to lock contention (which implies that no lock contention == no eviction), we should say that a page _must_ be evicted if it causes lock contention (which says nothing about what happens when there's no lock contention)",
    "created_at": "2023-08-15T16:58:35Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-08-15T16:59:48Z",
