    "body": "> This allows the site to have the performance gains of BFCache up until it would be made aware of the BFCache.\r\n\r\nThis sentence is a bit misleading, since it suggests there is just \"the site\", whereas there are two pages in question here: (1) the page in the BFCache, and (2) the active page. These pages may not correspond to the same site for local file system access",
